{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EgMKZfM2GpGiKA5K2Y5Kza","type":"tool_result","content":"id door window column stairs fence roof gate stone-wall wall-corner doorway wide-window ruined-wall balcony bridge chimney battlement trapdoor stone-steps timber-wall id barrel crate clay-pot amphora urn basket bucket keg strongbox crate-stack id crystal rubble glowcaps standard stalagmites cobweb puddle mine-rail id chest bones cage coffin banner spikes altar sarcophagus tombstone skull-pile wall-chains portcullis lever pressure-plate obelisk rune-stone pillory pit-grate id table chair bench stool bed bookshelf cabinet wardrobe desk dresser throne armchair rug fireplace wall-shelf round-table washstand cradle folding-screen id lamp-post flame wall-torch brazier candles hanging-lantern campfire standing-torch chandelier wall-lantern path-lantern id rock stone-ring pine oak bush stump log mushrooms flowers snowy-pine birch dead-tree willow cactus reeds ferns tall-grass boulders lily-pads fallen-tree id signpost sack anvil pickaxe gold-pile cart shovel hammer wheelbarrow rope-coil ladder waymarker notice-board loot-pouch id statue well market-stall arch brick-wall fountain haystack hitching-post produce-crate park-bench clothesline planter water-trough id greatsword sword axe mace sceptre dagger wand staff bow spear warhammer crossbow round-shield kite-shield greataxe halberd flail scythe quiver \n\n3648:### interface GaitSpec\n3649-\n3650-Procedural locomotion cycles with planted feet. Instead of posing every frame, describe\n3651-the gait (speed, cadence, stance, bounce, arm swing...) and the generator plants each\n3652-foot on the ground, sliding it backwards at exactly `speed` while it is in stance, then\n3653-swings it forward on an arc — heel strike, roll, toe-off included. Tweak numbers,\n3654-re-run `npm run anim -- check Walk`, look at the sheet.\n3655-\n3656-Phase: the RIGHT heel strikes at frame 0, the left at frames / 2.\n3657-\n3658-- `name: string`\n3659-- `frames: number`: One full cycle (two steps), frames at 30 fps.\n3660-- `speed: number`: Ground speed the cycle is authored for (m/s at playback rate 1).\n3661-- `stance: number`: Fraction of the cycle each foot is on the ground. Walk ≈ 0.55–0.6, run ≈ 0.3.\n3662-- `hip: number`: Mean pelvis height offset from rest (m); negative bends the knees.\n3663-- `bob?: number`: Pelvis bounce amplitude (m), twice per cycle.\n3664-- `low?: number`: Cycle fraction at which the pelvis is lowest (default: walk just after contact, run mid-stance).\n3665-- `squash?: number`: Squash at the lowest point (e.g. 0.05 = 5 % shorter, wider).\n3666-- `lift?: number`: How high the lowest point of the swinging foot clears the floor at its peak (m).\n3667-- `liftPeak?: number`: Where in the swing (0..1) the foot is highest (default 0.4).\n3668-- `reach?: number`: Shift the whole stride forward (m).\n2804:### interface HudOptions\n2805-\n2806-- `color?: HudColor`: Default 'white'.\n2807-- `shadow?: HudColor | false`: 1-pixel drop shadow color, or false. Default 'ink'.\n2808-- `scale?: number`: Integer art-pixel scale (2 = double-size glyphs). Default 1.\n2809-- `anchor?: HudAnchor`: Default 'top-left': x/y are offsets from that screen corner/edge, in art pixels.\n2810-\n2811-### hudPlace()\n2812-\n2813-```ts\n2814-function hudPlace(x: number, y: number, w: number, h: number, anchor: HudAnchor, size: Resolution): [number, number]\n2815-```\n2816-\n11:5. Physics: `BoxOptions`, `Breakable`, `BreakableOptions`, `Breakables`, `BridgeOptions`, `Built`, `chain`, `ChainOptions`, `CharacterAnim`, `CharacterController`, `CharacterOptions`, `Chunk`, `clothGrid`, `ClothOptions`, `Crumble`, `CrumbleOptions`, `DoorOptions`, `DriveInput`, `explode`, `ExplosionOptions`, `Field`, `fieldAcceleration`, `FieldOptions`, `FIXED_DT`, `FloaterOptions`, `Floaters`, `ForceFields`, `fractureBox`, `FractureOptions`, `hingeDoor`, `InstancedBodies`, `InstancedBodiesOptions`, `InstancedShape`