{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkmZ7yiLdiRBHDvUeyKF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CVh2fNb2mwKtruZAQ6onCh","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/ui/hud.js'; s=open(p).read()\n# One name per pack.\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    let shown = 0;\n    for (const m of w.monsters) {\n      if (m.dead || m.dormant || m.id === bossId) continue; const big = m.elite === 'rare' || m.elite === 'champion' || m.defn?.named;\n      if (!big && hoverM !== m) continue; if (shown++ > 6) break;\"\"\",\"\"\"    let shown = 0; const packs = new Set();\n    for (const m of w.monsters) {\n      if (m.dead || m.dormant || m.id === bossId) continue; const big = m.elite === 'rare' || m.elite === 'champion' || m.defn?.named;\n      if (!big && hoverM !== m) continue; if (big && hoverM !== m && packs.has(m.pack)) continue; if (m.pack) packs.add(m.pack); if (shown++ > 6) break;\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"ui.textC(ui.W / 2, 34, b.text, { color: b.big ? 'orange' : 'white', scale: s });\",\"ui.textC(ui.W / 2, this.play.world?.boss ? 46 : 34, b.text, { color: b.big ? 'orange' : 'white', scale: s });\")\n# Narrow windows: smaller bar, smaller map.\ns=s.replace(\"const ui = this.ui; const S = 26; const G = 3; const total = S * 6 + G * 5 + 2 * (S - 6) + 8; let x = Math.round(ui.W / 2 - total / 2); const y = ui.H - S - 12;\",\"const ui = this.ui; const narrow = ui.W < 300; const S = narrow ? 18 : 26; const G = narrow ? 1 : 3; const total = S * 6 + G * 5 + 2 * (S - 6) + 8; let x = Math.max(2, Math.round(ui.W / 2 - total / 2)); const y = ui.H - S - (narrow ? 58 : 12);\")\ns=s.replace(\"drawIcon(ui, x + 7, y + 6, sk.icon);\",\"drawIcon(ui, x + (S - 12) / 2, y + (S - 14) / 2, sk.icon);\")\ns=s.replace(\"if (!open) { ui.frame(x, y, S, S, 'night', 'ink'); drawIcon(ui, x + 7, y + 7, 'lock');\",\"if (!open) { ui.frame(x, y, S, S, 'night', 'ink'); drawIcon(ui, x + (S - 12) / 2, y + (S - 12) / 2, 'lock');\")\ns=s.replace(\"const ui = this.ui; const W = 72; const H = 54; const X = ui.W - W - 12; const Y = 12;\",\"const ui = this.ui; const W = ui.W < 300 ? 44 : 72; const H = ui.W < 300 ? 33 : 54; const X = ui.W - W - (ui.W < 300 ? 4 : 12); const Y = ui.W < 300 ? 4 : 12;\")\ns=s.replace(\"const ui = this.ui; const y = 12 + 54 + 6; const text = questText(w);\",\"const ui = this.ui; const y = (ui.W < 300 ? 40 : 72); const text = questText(w);\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    ui.text(12, 12, `LV ${h.level}`, { color: 'sand' }); const nx\"\"\",\"\"\"    if (ui.W < 300) { ui.text(4, 4, `LV ${h.level}`, { color: 'sand' }); ui.text(4, 13, fmt(h.gold), { color: 'sand' }); return; }\n    ui.text(12, 12, `LV ${h.level}`, { color: 'sand' }); const nx\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"    const cx = ui.W / 2; const y = 12; const H = 30;\\n\",\"    const cx = ui.W < 300 ? ui.W / 2 - 20 : ui.W / 2; const y = ui.W < 300 ? 4 : 12; const H = ui.W < 300 ? 18 : 30;\\n\")\ns=s.replace(\"ui.textC(cx, y + H + 2, `THE KNELL ${Math.floor(this.meter * 100)}%`, { color: 'sand' });\",\"ui.textC(cx, y + H + 2, ui.W < 300 ? `${Math.floor(this.meter * 100)}%` : `THE KNELL ${Math.floor(this.meter * 100)}%`, { color: 'sand' });\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/sim/bosses.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"if (!m.bossState) { if (w.heroes.some((h) => !h.dead && near(h, m.x, m.z, 30))) startBoss(w, m); else return; }\",\"if (!m.bossState) { if (w.heroes.some((h) => !h.dead && near(h, m.x, m.z, 15))) { startBoss(w, m); if (m.defn.boss === 'ambrose') { emit(w, { t: 'say', who: 'ambrose', text: 'My child. You have come so far, and you have tracked in so much mud. Let us pray.' }); emit(w, { t: 'music', song: 'ledger' }); } } else return; }\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/net/hubflow.js'; s=open(p).read()\na=s.index(\"    const W = Math.min(ui.W - 24, 380);\"); b=s.index(\"    const by = Y + H - 26;\")\ns=s[:a]+\"\"\"    const W = Math.min(ui.W - 8, 380); const X = ui.W / 2 - W / 2; const Y = 6; const H = ui.H - 12;\n    ui.frame(X, Y, W, H, 'sand', 'ink');\n    ui.textC(ui.W / 2, Y + 5, TITLE, { color: 'sand', scale: ui.measure(TITLE, 2) < W - 8 ? 2 : 1 });\n    let y = Y + 24; y += ui.para(X + 6, y, 'FILL THE KNELL, THEN SLAY ITS WARDEN TOGETHER.', W - 12, { color: 'white' }) + 3;\n    info.players.forEach((p) => { const rd = c.ready?.includes(p.id); ui.rect(X + 6, y, 7, 7, hubColors[p.id % 4]); ui.text(X + 16, y, String(p.name).slice(0, Math.floor((W - 90) / 6)), { color: hubColors[p.id % 4] }); ui.textR(X + W - 6, y, rd ? 'READY' : CLASSES[SEAT_CLASS[p.id % 4]].name.slice(0, 11), { color: rd ? 'lime' : 'mist' }); y += 10; });\n    y += 3; let x = X + 6;\n    for (const [a, l] of [['move', 'MOVE'], ['skill0', 'ATTACK'], ['skill1', 'SKILL'], ['dodge', 'DODGE'], ['potion', 'DRINK']]) { const lw = ui.measure(l) + 20 + (a === 'move' || a === 'dodge' ? 16 : 0); if (x + lw > X + W - 4) { x = X + 6; y += 13; } const pw = prompt(ui, x, y, a); x += pw + 3; x += ui.text(x, y + 2, l, { color: 'mist' }) + 6; }\n    y += 15; y += ui.para(X + 6, y, 'STAND ON A CLASS FONT FOR 2 S IN THE FIRST ROOM TO SWAP.', W - 12, { color: 'mist' }) + 3;\n    const secs = c.left === null || c.left === undefined ? '' : `${Math.ceil(c.left / 1000)} S`;\n    ui.textC(ui.W / 2, y, c.paused ? 'HOLDING: MORE TIME ASKED' : c.starting ? 'STARTING' : secs, { color: 'sand' });\n\"\"\"+s[b:]\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    if (ui.button('card:ready', ui.W / 2 - 110, by, 104, 20, c.ready?.includes(info.me) ? 'READY!' : 'READY', { border: 'lime' })\"\"\",\"\"\"    const bw = Math.floor((W - 16) / 2);\n    if (ui.button('card:ready', X + 5, by, bw, 20, c.ready?.includes(info.me) ? 'READY!' : 'READY', { border: 'lime' })\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    if (ui.button('card:more', ui.W / 2 + 6, by, 104, 20, c.asked ? 'NEVER MIND' : 'MORE TIME', { first: false })\"\"\",\"\"\"    if (ui.button('card:more', X + 11 + bw, by, bw, 20, c.asked ? 'NEVER MIND' : 'MORE TIME', { first: false })\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > docs/DESIGNERS.md <<'EOF'\n# Tolled You So: recipes for designers\n\nAll content is plain tables in `src/data`. Build with `node tools/build.mjs`, test with `node tools/test.mjs`. Dev Mode (pause menu) tests any of it at once.\n\n- **A monster:** add a row to `MONSTERS` in `src/data/monsters.js` (life and hit multiples, speed, `brain`, `body`). A humanoid body is a `ModelDef` in `src/view/models/monsters.js`, built with `humanoid()`. Add its id to `HUMANOID` in `src/view/actors.js`. List it in a zone's `monsters`. It appears in Dev Mode's Spawn tab by itself.\n- **A brain:** add a function to `BRAINS` in `src/sim/monsters.js`. Anything worth over a quarter of a life bar goes through `telegraph()`.\n- **A skill or Tone:** add to the class in `src/data/classes.js`. `fx` lists effect ops from `src/sim/effects.js`; a Tone uses `set`, `patch`, `add`, `addThen`, `fxAll`, `cd`, `wind` or `charges`. `tests/sim/skills.test.mjs` casts every one.\n- **An item power:** add to `LEGENDARIES` in `src/data/items.js`, then apply it in `effectiveSkill` (skills) or `recalc` (numbers).\n- **A room:** add ASCII to a biome in `src/data/rooms.js`. Legend at the top. `tests/sim/zones.test.mjs` proves entrance to exit for 200 seeds.\n- **A zone:** add a row to `ZONES` in `src/data/zones.js`; furniture and scripts go in `buildZoneProps` and `zoneTick` in `src/sim/quests.js`.\n- **A quest:** add steps to `QUESTS` in `src/sim/quests.js`. Each has `text`, `zone`, `done(w)` and `obj(w)`; the HUD, the map and the bot all read `obj`.\n- **A line of dialogue:** `DIALOG` in `src/data/dialog.js`. Keep to the HUD font; the lint test checks it. Voices follow `SPEAKERS`.\n- **A song or sound:** `src/audio/songs.js` (text patterns), `src/audio/sfxdata.js` (`SoundDef`s). Lint renders every one.\n- **A model:** `node check.mjs --sheets src/view/models/props.js`, then open the PNGs.\n- **Balance:** `src/data/tuning.js` holds every number; each row is a Dev Mode slider. `node tools/report.mjs` prints minutes per zone, deaths, levels, boss durations and drops.\n- **New clips:** `src/view/clips.js`. Keep keys linear and give every joint in every key; `tests/sim/lint.test.mjs` scans compiled tracks for NaN.\nEOF\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n- docs/DESIGNERS.md done. Narrow-window HUD and card done. REMAINING: exit-interview.json at work/ root (count from tests/ISSUES.md), rebuild, node tools/test.mjs full, cleanup (tools/scratch, tools/out, check/), final reply with all four feedback sections.\nEOF\nwc -l tests/ISSUES.md; grep -c \"\\[C\\]\" tests/ISSUES.md; find src game.js -name '*.js' | xargs cat | wc -l; node tools/build.mjs --quiet && node tools/scratch/s5.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-200","description":"Polish labels and narrow layouts, write designer docs, rebuild","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12287,"cache_read_input_tokens":776092,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12287},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69254de6-4061-470e-8e76-10f1ee96c6e5","uuid":"6772dd26-ae83-45b5-8cc5-bd4205797a3e","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:00:23.708Z","request_id":"req_011CgkmZ6bs5w8o68x7v4MKh","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01CVh2fNb2mwKtruZAQ6onCh":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/ui/hud.js'; s=open(p).read()\n# One name per pack.\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    let shown = 0;\n    for (const m of w.monsters) {\n      if (m.dead || m.dormant || m.id === bossId) continue; const big = m.elite === 'rare' || m.elite === 'champion' || m.defn?.named;\n      if (!big && hoverM !== m) continue; if (shown++ > 6) break;\"\"\",\"\"\"    let shown = 0; const packs = new Set();\n    for (const m of w.monsters) {\n      if (m.dead || m.dormant || m.id === bossId) continue; const big = m.elite === 'rare' || m.elite === 'champion' || m.defn?.named;\n      if (!big && hoverM !== m) continue; if (big && hoverM !== m && packs.has(m.pack)) continue; if (m.pack) packs.add(m.pack); if (shown++ > 6) break;\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"ui.textC(ui.W / 2, 34, b.text, { color: b.big ? 'orange' : 'white', scale: s });\",\"ui.textC(ui.W / 2, this.play.world?.boss ? 46 : 34, b.text, { color: b.big ? 'orange' : 'white', scale: s });\")\n# Narrow windows: smaller bar, smaller map.\ns=s.replace(\"const ui = this.ui; const S = 26; const G = 3; const total = S * 6 + G * 5 + 2 * (S - 6) + 8; let x = Math.round(ui.W / 2 - total / 2); const y = ui.H - S - 12;\",\"const ui = this.ui; const narrow = ui.W < 300; const S = narrow ? 18 : 26; const G = narrow ? 1 : 3; const total = S * 6 + G * 5 + 2 * (S - 6) + 8; let x = Math.max(2, Math.round(ui.W / 2 - total / 2)); const y = ui.H - S - (narrow ? 58 : 12);\")\ns=s.replace(\"drawIcon(ui, x + 7, y + 6, sk.icon);\",\"drawIcon(ui, x + (S - 12) / 2, y + (S - 14) / 2, sk.icon);\")\ns=s.replace(\"if (!open) { ui.frame(x, y, S, S, 'night', 'ink'); drawIcon(ui, x + 7, y + 7, 'lock');\",\"if (!open) { ui.frame(x, y, S, S, 'night', 'ink'); drawIcon(ui, x + (S - 12) / 2, y + (S - 12) / 2, 'lock');\")\ns=s.replace(\"const ui = this.ui; const W = 72; const H = 54; const X = ui.W - W - 12; const Y = 12;\",\"const ui = this.ui; const W = ui.W < 300 ? 44 : 72; const H = ui.W < 300 ? 33 : 54; const X = ui.W - W - (ui.W < 300 ? 4 : 12); const Y = ui.W < 300 ? 4 : 12;\")\ns=s.replace(\"const ui = this.ui; const y = 12 + 54 + 6; const text = questText(w);\",\"const ui = this.ui; const y = (ui.W < 300 ? 40 : 72); const text = questText(w);\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    ui.text(12, 12, `LV ${h.level}`, { color: 'sand' }); const nx\"\"\",\"\"\"    if (ui.W < 300) { ui.text(4, 4, `LV ${h.level}`, { color: 'sand' }); ui.text(4, 13, fmt(h.gold), { color: 'sand' }); return; }\n    ui.text(12, 12, `LV ${h.level}`, { color: 'sand' }); const nx\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"    const cx = ui.W / 2; const y = 12; const H = 30;\\n\",\"    const cx = ui.W < 300 ? ui.W / 2 - 20 : ui.W / 2; const y = ui.W < 300 ? 4 : 12; const H = ui.W < 300 ? 18 : 30;\\n\")\ns=s.replace(\"ui.textC(cx, y + H + 2, `THE KNELL ${Math.floor(this.meter * 100)}%`, { color: 'sand' });\",\"ui.textC(cx, y + H + 2, ui.W < 300 ? `${Math.floor(this.meter * 100)}%` : `THE KNELL ${Math.floor(this.meter * 100)}%`, { color: 'sand' });\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/sim/bosses.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"if (!m.bossState) { if (w.heroes.some((h) => !h.dead && near(h, m.x, m.z, 30))) startBoss(w, m); else return; }\",\"if (!m.bossState) { if (w.heroes.some((h) => !h.dead && near(h, m.x, m.z, 15))) { startBoss(w, m); if (m.defn.boss === 'ambrose') { emit(w, { t: 'say', who: 'ambrose', text: 'My child. You have come so far, and you have tracked in so much mud. Let us pray.' }); emit(w, { t: 'music', song: 'ledger' }); } } else return; }\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/net/hubflow.js'; s=open(p).read()\na=s.index(\"    const W = Math.min(ui.W - 24, 380);\"); b=s.index(\"    const by = Y + H - 26;\")\ns=s[:a]+\"\"\"    const W = Math.min(ui.W - 8, 380); const X = ui.W / 2 - W / 2; const Y = 6; const H = ui.H - 12;\n    ui.frame(X, Y, W, H, 'sand', 'ink');\n    ui.textC(ui.W / 2, Y + 5, TITLE, { color: 'sand', scale: ui.measure(TITLE, 2) < W - 8 ? 2 : 1 });\n    let y = Y + 24; y += ui.para(X + 6, y, 'FILL THE KNELL, THEN SLAY ITS WARDEN TOGETHER.', W - 12, { color: 'white' }) + 3;\n    info.players.forEach((p) => { const rd = c.ready?.includes(p.id); ui.rect(X + 6, y, 7, 7, hubColors[p.id % 4]); ui.text(X + 16, y, String(p.name).slice(0, Math.floor((W - 90) / 6)), { color: hubColors[p.id % 4] }); ui.textR(X + W - 6, y, rd ? 'READY' : CLASSES[SEAT_CLASS[p.id % 4]].name.slice(0, 11), { color: rd ? 'lime' : 'mist' }); y += 10; });\n    y += 3; let x = X + 6;\n    for (const [a, l] of [['move', 'MOVE'], ['skill0', 'ATTACK'], ['skill1', 'SKILL'], ['dodge', 'DODGE'], ['potion', 'DRINK']]) { const lw = ui.measure(l) + 20 + (a === 'move' || a === 'dodge' ? 16 : 0); if (x + lw > X + W - 4) { x = X + 6; y += 13; } const pw = prompt(ui, x, y, a); x += pw + 3; x += ui.text(x, y + 2, l, { color: 'mist' }) + 6; }\n    y += 15; y += ui.para(X + 6, y, 'STAND ON A CLASS FONT FOR 2 S IN THE FIRST ROOM TO SWAP.', W - 12, { color: 'mist' }) + 3;\n    const secs = c.left === null || c.left === undefined ? '' : `${Math.ceil(c.left / 1000)} S`;\n    ui.textC(ui.W / 2, y, c.paused ? 'HOLDING: MORE TIME ASKED' : c.starting ? 'STARTING' : secs, { color: 'sand' });\n\"\"\"+s[b:]\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    if (ui.button('card:ready', ui.W / 2 - 110, by, 104, 20, c.ready?.includes(info.me) ? 'READY!' : 'READY', { border: 'lime' })\"\"\",\"\"\"    const bw = Math.floor((W - 16) / 2);\n    if (ui.button('card:ready', X + 5, by, bw, 20, c.ready?.includes(info.me) ? 'READY!' : 'READY', { border: 'lime' })\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    if (ui.button('card:more', ui.W / 2 + 6, by, 104, 20, c.asked ? 'NEVER MIND' : 'MORE TIME', { first: false })\"\"\",\"\"\"    if (ui.button('card:more', X + 11 + bw, by, bw, 20, c.asked ? 'NEVER MIND' : 'MORE TIME', { first: false })\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > docs/DESIGNERS.md <<'EOF'\n# Tolled You So: recipes for designers\n\nAll content is plain tables in `src/data`. Build with `node tools/build.mjs`, test with `node tools/test.mjs`. Dev Mode (pause menu) tests any of it at once.\n\n- **A monster:** add a row to `MONSTERS` in `src/data/monsters.js` (life and hit multiples, speed, `brain`, `body`). A humanoid body is a `ModelDef` in `src/view/models/monsters.js`, built with `humanoid()`. Add its id to `HUMANOID` in `src/view/actors.js`. List it in a zone's `monsters`. It appears in Dev Mode's Spawn tab by itself.\n- **A brain:** add a function to `BRAINS` in `src/sim/monsters.js`. Anything worth over a quarter of a life bar goes through `telegraph()`.\n- **A skill or Tone:** add to the class in `src/data/classes.js`. `fx` lists effect ops from `src/sim/effects.js`; a Tone uses `set`, `patch`, `add`, `addThen`, `fxAll`, `cd`, `wind` or `charges`. `tests/sim/skills.test.mjs` casts every one.\n- **An item power:** add to `LEGENDARIES` in `src/data/items.js`, then apply it in `effectiveSkill` (skills) or `recalc` (numbers).\n- **A room:** add ASCII to a biome in `src/data/rooms.js`. Legend at the top. `tests/sim/zones.test.mjs` proves entrance to exit for 200 seeds.\n- **A zone:** add a row to `ZONES` in `src/data/zones.js`; furniture and scripts go in `buildZoneProps` and `zoneTick` in `src/sim/quests.js`.\n- **A quest:** add steps to `QUESTS` in `src/sim/quests.js`. Each has `text`, `zone`, `done(w)` and `obj(w)`; the HUD, the map and the bot all read `obj`.\n- **A line of dialogue:** `DIALOG` in `src/data/dialog.js`. Keep to the HUD font; the lint test checks it. Voices follow `SPEAKERS`.\n- **A song or sound:** `src/audio/songs.js` (text patterns), `src/audio/sfxdata.js` (`SoundDef`s). Lint renders every one.\n- **A model:** `node check.mjs --sheets src/view/models/props.js`, then open the PNGs.\n- **Balance:** `src/data/tuning.js` holds every number; each row is a Dev Mode slider. `node tools/report.mjs` prints minutes per zone, deaths, levels, boss durations and drops.\n- **New clips:** `src/view/clips.js`. Keep keys linear and give every joint in every key; `tests/sim/lint.test.mjs` scans compiled tracks for NaN.\nEOF\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n- docs/DESIGNERS.md done. Narrow-window HUD and card done. REMAINING: exit-interview.json at work/ root (count from tests/ISSUES.md), rebuild, node tools/test.mjs full, cleanup (tools/scratch, tools/out, check/), final reply with all four feedback sections.\nEOF\nwc -l tests/ISSUES.md; grep -c \"\\[C\\]\" tests/ISSUES.md; find src game.js -name '*.js' | xargs cat | wc -l; node tools/build.mjs --quiet && node tools/scratch/s5.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-200","description":"Polish labels and narrow layouts, write designer docs, rebuild","timeout":120000}}}
